    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Weirdboy",
    "summary": "A psychic level 1 ability, usable once per battle round across your army. During your Movement phase, a Weirdboy unit that is not battle-shocked may make a psychic roll of one D6. If it does, a roll of 1 battle-shocks the unit, and regardless of the result the unit is placed into Strategic Reserves and gains Deep Strike.",
